"original","quote":"坚四子：策、权、翊、匡〖21〗。权既称尊号〖22〗，谥坚曰武烈皇帝〖23〗。﹝七﹞","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":134,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-o033","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-fe64807ea9dcb47036d8","layer":"original","quote":"是时，袁绍方强〖25〗，而策并江东。曹公力未能逞，且欲抚之：﹝九﹞乃以弟女配策小弟匡，又为子（章）〔彰〕取贲女〖26〗；皆礼辟策弟权、翊；又命扬州刺吏严象，举权茂才〖27〗。","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-p031","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-2bb8a4c16eea9112d005","layer":"pei","quote":"《志林》曰：“坚有五子：策、权、翊、匡，吴氏所生；少子朗，庶生也，一名仁。”","attribution":"《志林》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":175,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-dfa6547151f4d194f8a1","start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o009a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-2545400e76cb3abb0431","layer":"original","quote":"九年〖26〗，权弟丹杨太守翊，为左右所害；以从兄瑜〖27〗，代翊。﹝三﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o009","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-2545400e76cb3abb0431","layer":"original","quote":"九年〖26〗，权弟丹杨太守翊，为左右所害；以从兄瑜〖27〗，代翊。﹝三﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-b-1274098c4e3707963c03","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-1274098c4e3707963c03","layer":"modern","quote":"〖5〗九年：建安九年（公元 204）。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-05ec5dccb4a2549f7141","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o024","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-8f5617c1f161dca84cfc","layer":"original","quote":"九年〖5〗，太祖拔邺，领冀州牧。或说太祖：“宜复古，置九州〖6〗；则冀州所制者广大〖7〗，天下服矣。”太祖将从之。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":121,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-7772c2905aa6b5842382","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-830e1b7b03ae5a272e12","layer":"original","quote":"初，权弟翊，性峭急〖10〗，喜怒快意〖11〗。治数责数〖12〗，喻以道义","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-02273604f428006e07b4","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b01cfcdeadd92ea5d12f","layer":"original","quote":"孙翊为丹杨〖4〗，皆礼致之。览为丹杨都尉督兵〖5〗，员为郡丞","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":44,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-023f5437b202ea0123d7","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"诸将皆知览、员所为，而力不能讨。览入居军府中，悉取翊嫔妾及左右侍御。欲复取徐，恐逆之见害，乃绐之曰：‘乞须晦日，设祭除服","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":183,"end":243,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-06cb38c40c30257ca0a5","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"妫览、戴员亲近边鸿等，数为翊所困，常欲叛逆；因吴主出征，遂其奸计","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":10,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-0a6c8d86ae13e539cd63","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-51c9737905162f0e6527","layer":"original","quote":"建安八年，以偏将军领丹杨太守，时年二十","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":146,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-123a16ed7398c9e69dac","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b01cfcdeadd92ea5d12f","layer":"original","quote":"及翊遇害，河驰赴宛陵〖7〗；责怒览、员以不能全（权）〔翊〕〖8〗，令使奸变得施","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":78,"end":117,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-38e3831bb79e583e86b5","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b01cfcdeadd92ea5d12f","layer":"original","quote":"会翊帐下徐元、孙高、傅婴等杀览、员","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":200,"end":217,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-49cac9a188042fcbb699","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-1573afc0600a9c23d1a8","layer":"pei","quote":"策临卒，张昭等谓策当以兵属俨；而策呼权，佩以印绶","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":156,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8e16addacce33d44c965","start":18,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-5cae10fb73526a68fd7f","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"到晦日，设祭；徐氏哭泣尽哀毕，乃徐服，熏香沐浴；更于他室，安施帏帐，言笑欢悦，示无戚容。大小凄怆，怪其如此。览密觇视，无复疑意","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":405,"end":468,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-6c296446abde8dae28e8","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"翊以妻徐氏颇晓卜，翊入语徐：‘吾明日欲为长吏作主人，卿试卜之。’徐言：‘卦不能佳！可须异日。’翊以长吏来久，宜速遣，乃大请宾客","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":54,"end":117,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-a5f0ea7471a824564e27","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-d2edf9c41227a70afff2","layer":"original","quote":"太守朱治举孝廉〖1〗，司空辟","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":145,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-b5917c4ae17a2c4d11ea","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"吴主续至，悉族诛览、员余党；擢高、婴为牙门；其余皆加赐金帛，殊其门户","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":578,"end":612,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-b7c66ed0bd6d185d3ce7","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"徐氏购募追捕，中宿乃得，览、员归罪杀鸿","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":163,"end":182,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-c9387adcb31248735ccc","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-51c9737905162f0e6527","layer":"original","quote":"后卒为左右边鸿所杀，鸿亦即诛","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":146,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-d1a125929176ccc56336","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"徐呼高、婴与诸婢罗住户内，使人报览，说：‘已除凶即吉，惟府君敕命。’览盛意入，徐出户拜。览适得一拜，徐便大呼：‘二君可起！’高、婴俱出，共得杀览；余人即就外杀员","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":469,"end":549,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-d6ff96725d7ebcf306dd","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"乃密呼翊时侍养者二十余人，以徐意语之；共盟誓，合谋","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":379,"end":404,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-e0f7b97e0f4b4257d2b7","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"夫人乃还缞绖，奉览、员首，以祭翊墓。举军震骇，以为神异","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":550,"end":577,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-f322729b1771bdb3ae8a","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"时月垂竟，览听须祭毕。徐潜使所亲信，语翊亲近旧将孙高、傅婴等，说：‘览已虏略婢妾，今又欲见逼；所以外许之者，欲安其意以免祸耳。欲立微计，愿二君哀救！’高、婴涕泣答言：‘受府君恩遇，所以不即死难者，以死无益，欲思惟事计；事计未立，未敢启夫人耳。今日之事，实夙夜所怀也","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":245,"end":377,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-feb340e6a390f4c8beb6","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"翊出入常持刀，尔时有酒色，空手送客；鸿从后斫翊，郡中扰乱，无救翊者：遂为鸿所杀，迸走入山","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":118,"end":162,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
